[{"id":1,"title":"用 deepseek 的 api+ccswitch 效果怎么样？","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3210/t/1","content":"最近在折腾用 deepseek 的 API 配合 ccswitch 做 Claude Code 的后端，想问下大家实际用下来的效果如何？\n\n主要关心：\n\n- 工具调用是否稳定\n- 长上下文会不会截断\n- 代码补全质量跟官方 Claude 差多少\n\n目前我的体验是工具调用偶尔会有格式问题，补全质量尚可但复杂重构明显吃力。","content_rendered":"<p>最近在折腾用 deepseek 的 API 配合 ccswitch 做 Claude Code 的后端，想问下大家实际用下来的效果如何？</p>\n<p>主要关心：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工具调用是否稳定</li>\n<li>长上下文会不会截断</li>\n<li>代码补全质量跟官方 Claude 差多少</li>\n</ul>\n<p>目前我的体验是工具调用偶尔会有格式问题，补全质量尚可但复杂重构明显吃力。</p>\n","replies":1,"member":{"id":2,"username":"lisi","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3210/member/lisi","tagline":null,"bio":null,"created":1794151867,"last_modified":1794151867,"location":null,"website":null,"twitter":null,"github":null,"psn":null,"btc":null,"pro":0,"avatar_mini":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_normal":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_large":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_xlarge":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_xxlarge":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_xxxlarge":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,"},"node":{"id":4,"name":"claude","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3210/go/claude","title":"Claude","title_alternative":"Claude","topics":1,"stars":0,"header":"","footer":"","founder_id":1,"root":false,"parent_node_name":"programmer","aliases":[],"avatar_mini":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_normal":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_large":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,"},"created":1794145931,"last_modified":1794145931,"last_touched":1794145991,"last_reply_by":"zhaoliu","deleted":0}]